    "And for what purpose? You could have joined, we could have cooperated.": "你又是为了什么？你本来可以加入，我们本来可以合作。",
    "Antimatter Dimensions: the next update is always 5 hours away. Always.": "《反物质维度》：下一次更新永远还要等 5 小时。永远。",
    "Any sufficiently primitive magic is indistinguishable from technology.": "任何足够原始的魔法，都与技术无异。",
    "Challenges for upgrading autobuyers are unlocked by reaching Infinity.": "解锁自动购买器升级的挑战需在达成无限状态后开启。",
    "Check to make sure you typed in the correct name for your study preset": "确认你输入了正确的时间研究预设名称",
    "Effects from Glyph Sacrifice, Alteration, and Alchemy are all disabled": "符文献祭、符文异变和符文炼金的所有效果均被禁用。",
    "Have you saved your game? If so, then you can continue playing without": "保存游戏了吗？保存了的话，你就可以继续玩，不必",
    "He said he could not afford a new ship, so he built a new one instead.": "他说他买不起一艘新船，所以他建造了一艘新船。",
    "If you are reading this, that means 1) we exist, and you can exist too": "如果您正在阅读本文，那就意味着 1）我们存在，您也可以存在",
    "If you want to farm infinities, why don't you just get the time study?": "想刷无限次数，为什么不直接买对应的时间研究？",
    "Infinity Dimension multiplier based on sum of Infinity Challenge times": "无限挑战最佳用时的总和越短，无限维度倍率越高。",
    "Is this the big news? Yes. Is this the big news? Almost certainly not.": "这是大新闻吗？是的。这是大新闻吗？几乎可以肯定不是。",
    "Man, I wish I never got old news. It's too good to last me any longer.": "伙计，我希望我从来没有收到旧消息。它太好了，我不能再继续下去了。",
    "Nuclear power plants have been abandoned in favor of antimatter power.": "核电站已被弃用，取而代之的是反物质能源。",
    "Provide the id of a saved study preset slot from the Time Studies page": "查看时间研究页面，输入正确的时间研究预设序号",
    "Rate 5 on Kongregate so more people can experience this 5 star rating.": "请在 Kongregate 上给出五星评价，让更多人也能体验这款五星游戏。",
    "Take a moment to thank the gods of reddit for having saved your bacon.": "花点时间感谢 Reddit 之神拯救了你的培根。",
