    "Dimension Boost multiplier gains a power effect based on Teresa level": "维度提升倍率获得基于特蕾莎等级的指数加成",
    "Hold shift to see the Eternity Point cost for locked Time Dimensions.": "按住 Shift 可查看未解锁时间维度所需的永恒点数。",
