    "Any Glyphs with rarity below these thresholds will be sacrificed.": "所有低于以下稀有度阈值的符文将被献祭。",
    "Autobuyers with no displayed bulk have unlimited bulk by default.": "未显示数量限制的自动购买器默认拥有无限数量处理能力。",
