    "Our deepest apologies for the new glyph mechanic. The intent is to provide players with a sense of pride and accomplishment for unlocking rare glyphs. We selected initial values based upon data from the final wave of testing and other adjustments made to milestone rewards before launch. Among other things, we're looking at average per-player credit earn rates on a daily basis, and we'll be making constant adjustments to ensure that players have challenges that are compelling, rewarding, and of course attainable via gameplay.",
